# Unlike other loop-eng projects, THIS project's spine and harness log must
# persist across runs: it's driven by an unattended cloud routine, which
# clones fresh every single beat (A4). The parent loop-eng/.gitignore
# excludes progress.md and loop.log repo-wide (correct for projects run
# locally by a human, where the file just lives on disk between runs) --
# but for a fresh-clone-every-time cloud routine, gitignoring the spine
# means every beat starts from zero and nothing ever accumulates. That is
# not a hypothetical: it is what actually happened here (see Project 12's
# README for how it was found and fixed) -- three real beats ran, and each
# one only ever saw its own single entry, because the previous beat's
# write never reached GitHub. Un-ignore both files for this project only;
# see SKILL.md for how they're now kept persistent via a dedicated branch.
!progress.md
!loop.log
